[org ; Question: Lab9 Task 1 - compare two memory blocks byte-by-byte.
; Solution: memcompare takes pointers to block1 and block2 plus length, loops with SI/DI/CX, and returns 0 if equal or 1 if mismatch.
[org 0x100]
